  "notes": "Fluent Reader, an Electron RSS reader mimicking Windows 11 / Fluent Design: custom title bar with window controls (minimize/maximize/close) in-page, grey #edebe9 nav pane with blue left selection bar on 'All articles', favicon squares for each feed. Article list in 'Magazine view': centered ~748px column, hairline dividers, 200x160 thumbnails on left when available. Read articles fade to grey (#8a8886) title and body; unread show a small orange dot before relative timestamp. View menu (eye icon) holds view modes (Card/List/Magazine/Compact), filtering (All/Unread/Starred) and search options. Clicking an article opens a modal reader overlay with serif typography and prev/next arrows (not in capture). Sidebar has a filter icon button beside 'Subscriptions'."
